2026-10-08T23:04:35.1041984Z   ok   an unconfigured input is not a problem
2026-10-08T23:04:35.1042603Z   ok   a non-numeric state does not raise
2026-10-08T23:04:35.1043319Z   ok   a non-finite state string is refused exactly like a word
