2026-10-08T23:04:35.2070912Z -- v5.3.0 — defrost: duty is measured, the derate is physics
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2071146Z   ok   the inferred estimator reads a real defrost as a PERFECT interval
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2071343Z   ok   an over-1 ratio can no longer park the derate above 1.0
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2071532Z   ok   five defrosting minutes in thirty is a duty of 1/6
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2071793Z   ok   and the interval counts as observed
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2072091Z   ok   a quiet interval is duty zero AND observed — that is real evidence
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2072281Z   ok   an unreadable flag yields duty zero but NOT observed
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2072499Z   ok   a defrost spanning an interval boundary keeps its second half
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2072730Z   ok   a sample stamped before the last does not subtract from the on-time
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2072863Z   ok   zero duty is no derate at all
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2073026Z   ok   the derate is 1 - duty x the loss multiplier
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2073229Z   ok   more duty is always a deeper derate, never a shallower one
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2073444Z   ok   and it is bounded below, so a latched flag cannot zero the pump
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2073616Z   ok   a measured bucket derates from its counted duty
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2073869Z   ok   and a measurement is never averaged with an inference of the same thing
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2074199Z   ok   an untouched bucket still derates nothing
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2074551Z   ok   the summary says which estimator a bucket rests on, and how many defrosts were actually witnessed
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2074764Z   ok   a duty outside [0, 1] is refused, not folded into the bucket
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2075053Z   ok   the range guard rejects only OUTSIDE [0, 1] — 0 and 1 still fold
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2075275Z   ok   a pre-v5.3.0 store loads without raising, and says it was upgraded
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2075435Z   ok   its learned factors are KEPT, not discarded
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2075642Z   ok   but the estimator's optimistic tail is clamped away on load
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2075849Z   ok   a measured duty then overrides the carried-over inference
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2075979Z   ok   a v2 store round-trips exactly
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2076207Z   ok   a v2 store still carries factors/counts, so a DOWNGRADE loads too
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2076416Z   ok   a garbage store loads as empty rather than raising (None)
