2026-10-08T23:04:35.2076801Z   ok   a garbage store loads as empty rather than raising ([])
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2077010Z   ok   a garbage store loads as empty rather than raising ('nope')
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2077292Z   ok   a garbage store loads as empty rather than raising ({'factors': 'bad', 'duty': 3})
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2077544Z   ok   a window whose clock cannot be compared measures nothing, and is refused
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2077839Z   ok   inside 0-5 °C an interval with NO defrost now teaches the COP scale
2026-10-08T23:04:35.2078043Z   ok   and an interval that DID contain a defrost is still refused
