2026-10-08T23:04:35.3732610Z === Manual plan override ===
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3732617Z 
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3732757Z -- Slot parsing and validation
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3732922Z   ok   omitted channel stays None (fully automatic)
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3733247Z   ok   explicit empty list stays [] (off for the whole period)
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3733385Z   ok   slots are sorted by start time
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3733484Z   ok   rejects end == start
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3733586Z   ok   rejects end < start
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3733715Z   ok   rejects overlapping slots
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3733847Z   ok   rejects unparseable datetime
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3733965Z   ok   rejects a non-object slot
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3734096Z   ok   rejects expires_at in the past
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3734231Z   ok   ManualPlanError is a ValueError
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3734238Z 
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3734351Z -- Channel pin semantics
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3734476Z   ok   omitted channel yields no pins
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3734619Z   ok   supplied channel yields a pin array
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3734739Z   ok   pins on inside the slot
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3734897Z   ok   pins off outside the slot but before expiry
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3735132Z   ok   free at and beyond expiry
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3735286Z   ok   pinned_step_count counts the on steps
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3735425Z   ok   empty list forces off up to expiry
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3735575Z   ok   empty list still frees steps past expiry
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3735771Z   ok   a slot starting mid-step pins the step it lands in ON
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3735964Z   ok   and the partially covered trailing step stays ON too
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3735975Z 
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3736088Z -- Serialisation round-trip
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3736266Z   ok   space channel empty-list survives the round-trip
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3736429Z   ok   dhw channel slots survive the round-trip
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3736560Z   ok   expiry survives the round-trip
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3736691Z   ok   from_dict rejects a missing expiry
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3736699Z 
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3736843Z -- Pins change the solved schedule
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3737024Z   ok   forcing space on adds a run the optimizer skipped
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3737177Z   ok   a manual-on step is labelled manual_plan
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3737304Z   ok   the override is flagged active
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3737439Z   ok   forcing hot water on adds a DHW run
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3737593Z   ok   a manual DHW step is labelled manual_plan
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3737822Z   ok   the summer plan has several runs, so the last one is a real choice
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3737987Z   ok   forcing hot water off removes a run when safe
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3738134Z   ok   a safe forced-off step is not released
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3738142Z 
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3738466Z -- A quiet Off window outranks a force-on pin (#1910)
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3738714Z   ok   an Off mask shorter than the horizon is padded off-free to its length
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3738921Z   ok   an Off mask is OR'd into the steps pins already forced off
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3739186Z   ok   a force-on hot-water pin inside an Off window plans nothing in its steps
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3739194Z 
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3739474Z -- An Off window plans the anti-legionella cycle outside itself (#1910)
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3739735Z   ok   with no Off window the overdue cycle is at step 1 and the tank reaches 60 C
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3739968Z   ok   an Off window covering the placed step plans the cycle outside it
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3740260Z   ok   an Off window elsewhere leaves the cycle at step 1 and buys no hot water inside it
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3740499Z   ok   an Off window on the deadline's cheap hour plans the cycle elsewhere
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3740681Z   ok   an elastic cycle shops the hour outside an Off window
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3740694Z 
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3740926Z -- Legionella placement when the slice is entirely off (#1910)
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3741173Z   ok   a slice the Off window covers entirely is bought at the next free step
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3741355Z   ok   no free step left places no anti-legionella cycle
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3741511Z   ok   no Off window charges every step of the reach
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3741676Z   ok   an Off step contributes nothing to the reach
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3741809Z 
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3742012Z -- Quiet-window arms the solve does not reach (#1910)
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3742176Z   ok   a negative horizon is no actions, not an error
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3742298Z   ok   a zero horizon is no actions
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3742434Z   ok   an unreadable spec is no actions
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3742654Z   ok   a non-string control and a switch control are domain verdicts
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3742812Z   ok   a power entity with no state is no reading
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3742944Z   ok   a zero power reading is no reading
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3743097Z   ok   an unrecognised power unit is no reading
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3743324Z   ok   no state callable and a non-positive nameplate measure nothing
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3743467Z   ok   a non-string power entity id is not read
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3743611Z   ok   a zero hertz reading measures nothing
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3743827Z   ok   a frequency entity whose range max is zero measures nothing
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3744283Z   ok   a non-positive nameplate has no silent cap, and fraction 1.0 caps nothing
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3744481Z   ok   a measured figure below the floor is raised to the floor
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3744695Z   ok   the configured fraction is the cap when nothing is measured
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3744929Z   ok   a measured ceiling equal to nameplate does not install a cap array
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3745114Z   ok   fraction 1.0 resolves the rows and installs no cap
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3745333Z   ok   a window the horizon never reaches leaves the caller's cap alone
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3745569Z   ok   a silent cap is the elementwise minimum with the caller's extra cap
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3745777Z   ok   a what-if fraction off the default is folded into the config
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3745969Z   ok   a what-if spec key is folded and an absent one is not
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3746228Z   ok   two empty specs parse as nothing; one empty spec does not drop the other
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3746493Z   ok   windows that only touch at an endpoint do not overlap, from either side
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3746765Z   ok   an off window overlapping a silent window is refused even with no hot water
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3746933Z   ok   an off window overlapping hot water is refused
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3747168Z   ok   a weekly quiet spec keeps its day selector through canonicalisation
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3747432Z   ok   absent quiet specs canonicalise to nothing, and a present one round-trips
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3747650Z   ok   a service call whose off window overlaps hot water is refused
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3747887Z   ok   an Off mask with no other cap still zeroes exactly its own space steps
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3748154Z   ok   the plan sensor publishes the not-enforced marker and the resolved actions
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3748528Z   ok   configured_specs returns the stored rows and the not-enforced marker
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3748764Z   ok   the monthly peak sensor publishes the tariff fields it was given
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3749022Z   ok   the default silent fraction is the unset value the fold compares against
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3749036Z 
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3749227Z -- Safety release fires only when a hard floor binds
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3749460Z   ok   forcing space off in the cold releases pins for the comfort floor
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3749613Z   ok   released space steps actually run again
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3749812Z   ok   forcing space off when it is not needed releases nothing
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3749994Z   ok   forcing hot water off with a low tank releases pins
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3750173Z   ok   a due legionella cycle is released when forced off
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3750382Z   ok   forcing hot water off when the tank is hot releases nothing
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3750390Z 
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3750582Z -- A timezone-less expiry is handled, not crashed on
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3750730Z   ok   a naive expiry does not raise TypeError
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3750919Z   ok   the stored expiry is comparable with the parsed slots
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3751225Z   ok   and the override can still be applied to the horizon
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3751419Z   ok   a naive expiry in the past is rejected as a plan error
2026-10-08T23:04:35.3751427Z 
